{"seq":1,"slug":"hadoop-ecosystem","title":"Hadoop 生态","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/hadoop-ecosystem","wordCount":950,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"hadoop-生态\">Hadoop 生态</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>Hadoop 是大数据技术的奠基平台，其&quot;分而治之&quot;的设计哲学深刻影响了所有后续分布式系统的架构思路。理解 Hadoop 生态不仅是操作集群的技能需求，更是建立分布式思维的必经之路。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hdfs-分布式文件系统\">HDFS 分布式文件系统</h3><p>HDFS（Hadoop Distributed File System）是为大规模数据存储设计的分布式文件系统，核心设计决策是&quot;写一次、读多次&quot;：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    C[&quot;客户端&quot;] --&gt; NN[&quot;NameNode&lt;br/&gt;元数据管理&quot;]&#10;    NN --&gt; DN1[&quot;DataNode 1&quot;]&#10;    NN --&gt; DN2[&quot;DataNode 2&quot;]&#10;    NN --&gt; DN3[&quot;DataNode 3&quot;]&#10;    DN1 --&gt; B1[&quot;Block A-1&quot;]&#10;    DN1 --&gt; B2[&quot;Block B-2&quot;]&#10;    DN2 --&gt; B3[&quot;Block A-2&quot;]&#10;    DN2 --&gt; B4[&quot;Block C-1&quot;]&#10;    DN3 --&gt; B5[&quot;Block A-3&quot;]&#10;    DN3 --&gt; B6[&quot;Block B-1&quot;]\">graph TB\n    C[\"客户端\"] --&gt; NN[\"NameNode&lt;br/&gt;元数据管理\"]\n    NN --&gt; DN1[\"DataNode 1\"]\n    NN --&gt; DN2[\"DataNode 2\"]\n    NN --&gt; DN3[\"DataNode 3\"]\n    DN1 --&gt; B1[\"Block A-1\"]\n    DN1 --&gt; B2[\"Block B-2\"]\n    DN2 --&gt; B3[\"Block A-2\"]\n    DN2 --&gt; B4[\"Block C-1\"]\n    DN3 --&gt; B5[\"Block A-3\"]\n    DN3 --&gt; B6[\"Block B-1\"]</pre><p>关键参数与操作：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# HDFS 基本操作&#10;hdfs dfs -mkdir -p /user/etl/input&#10;hdfs dfs -put local_data.csv /user/etl/input/&#10;hdfs dfs -ls -R /user/etl/&#10;hdfs dfs -du -s -h /user/etl/        # 查看目录大小&#10;&#10;# 关键配置参数&#10;# dfs.blocksize=128MB（默认），大文件可设为 256MB 减少 NameNode 内存压力&#10;# dfs.replication=3（默认副本因子）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># HDFS 基本操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hdfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -mkdir</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -p</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /user/etl/input</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hdfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -put</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> local_data.csv</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /user/etl/input/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hdfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -ls</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -R</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /user/etl/</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">hdfs</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> dfs</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -du</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -s</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -h</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> /user/etl/</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 查看目录大小</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 关键配置参数</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># dfs.blocksize=128MB（默认），大文件可设为 256MB 减少 NameNode 内存压力</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># dfs.replication=3（默认副本因子）</span></span></code></pre></div><p>HDFS 的块大小设计遵循一个简单原则：<strong>寻址时间应为传输时间的 1% 以下</strong>。假设磁盘寻址 10ms，传输速率 100MB/s，则块大小应 ≥ 100MB，因此默认 128MB。</p>\n<h3 id=\"mapreduce-编程模型\">MapReduce 编程模型</h3><p>MapReduce 将计算抽象为 Map（映射）和 Reduce（归约）两个阶段，实现&quot;移动计算而非移动数据&quot;：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"# Python Hadoop Streaming 示例：WordCount&#10;# mapper.py&#10;import sys&#10;for line in sys.stdin:&#10;    for word in line.strip().split():&#10;        print(f&quot;{word}\\t1&quot;)&#10;&#10;# reducer.py&#10;import sys&#10;current_word = None&#10;count = 0&#10;for line in sys.stdin:&#10;    word, val = line.strip().split(&#39;\\t&#39;)&#10;    if word == current_word:&#10;        count += int(val)&#10;    else:&#10;        if current_word:&#10;            print(f&quot;{current_word}\\t{count}&quot;)&#10;        current_word = word&#10;        count = int(val)&#10;if current_word:&#10;    print(f&quot;{current_word}\\t{count}&quot;)\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># Python Hadoop Streaming 示例：WordCount</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># mapper.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sys</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sys.stdin:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line.strip().split():</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">word</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">1\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># reducer.py</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sys</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">current_word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> None</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> sys.stdin:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    word, val </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> line.strip().split(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">\\t</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_word:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(val)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    else</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_word:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">            print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">current_word</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\t{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        current_word </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> word</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(val)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> current_word:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    print</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">current_word</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}\\t{</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">count</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">}</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span></code></pre></div><p>MapReduce 的执行流程：Input → Split → Map → Shuffle &amp; Sort → Reduce → Output。其中 <strong>Shuffle</strong> 阶段是性能瓶颈所在——涉及网络传输和磁盘 I/O。</p>\n<h3 id=\"yarn-资源管理\">YARN 资源管理</h3><p>YARN（Yet Another Resource Negotiator）将资源管理从计算框架中解耦，使 Hadoop 集群能同时运行 MapReduce、Spark、Flink 等多种引擎：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    Client[&quot;客户端&quot;] --&gt; RM[&quot;ResourceManager&lt;br/&gt;全局资源调度&quot;]&#10;    RM --&gt; NM1[&quot;NodeManager 1&quot;]&#10;    RM --&gt; NM2[&quot;NodeManager 2&quot;]&#10;    RM --&gt; NM3[&quot;NodeManager 3&quot;]&#10;    NM1 --&gt; C1[&quot;Container&lt;br/&gt;AM&quot;]&#10;    NM1 --&gt; C2[&quot;Container&lt;br/&gt;Task&quot;]&#10;    NM2 --&gt; C3[&quot;Container&lt;br/&gt;Task&quot;]&#10;    NM3 --&gt; C4[&quot;Container&lt;br/&gt;Task&quot;]\">graph TB\n    Client[\"客户端\"] --&gt; RM[\"ResourceManager&lt;br/&gt;全局资源调度\"]\n    RM --&gt; NM1[\"NodeManager 1\"]\n    RM --&gt; NM2[\"NodeManager 2\"]\n    RM --&gt; NM3[\"NodeManager 3\"]\n    NM1 --&gt; C1[\"Container&lt;br/&gt;AM\"]\n    NM1 --&gt; C2[\"Container&lt;br/&gt;Task\"]\n    NM2 --&gt; C3[\"Container&lt;br/&gt;Task\"]\n    NM3 --&gt; C4[\"Container&lt;br/&gt;Task\"]</pre><p>YARN 的资源单位是 Container，每个 Container 包含固定的 CPU 和内存配额。ApplicationMaster 负责向 ResourceManager 申请资源并协调任务执行。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hive-数据仓库\">Hive 数据仓库</h3><p>Hive 将 SQL 翻译为 MapReduce/Spark 作业，让熟悉 SQL 的分析师能直接查询 HDFS 上的海量数据：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"-- 创建外部表（数据存储在 HDFS，删表不删数据）&#10;CREATE EXTERNAL TABLE user_events (&#10;    user_id     STRING,&#10;    event_type  STRING,&#10;    event_time  TIMESTAMP,&#10;    properties  MAP&lt;STRING, STRING&gt;&#10;)&#10;PARTITIONED BY (dt STRING)&#10;STORED AS PARQUET&#10;LOCATION &#39;/dw/ods/user_events&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 分区加载&#10;ALTER TABLE user_events ADD PARTITION (dt=&#39;2026-05-07&#39;)&#10;LOCATION &#39;/dw/ods/user_events/dt=2026-05-07&#39;;&#10;&#10;-- 分析查询&#10;SELECT event_type,&#10;       COUNT(*) AS cnt,&#10;       COUNT(DISTINCT user_id) AS uv&#10;FROM user_events&#10;WHERE dt BETWEEN &#39;2026-05-01&#39; AND &#39;2026-05-07&#39;&#10;GROUP BY event_type&#10;ORDER BY cnt DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 创建外部表（数据存储在 HDFS，删表不删数据）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> EXTERNAL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_events (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    user_id     STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_type  STRING,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    event_time  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">TIMESTAMP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    properties  MAP</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">STRING, STRING</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">PARTITIONED </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dt STRING)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">STORED </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARQUET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LOCATION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/dw/ods/user_events'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分区加载</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ALTER</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_events </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ADD</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PARTITION</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (dt</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'2026-05-07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">LOCATION</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '/dw/ods/user_events/dt=2026-05-07'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">-- 分析查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">       COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_id) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uv</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> user_events</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BETWEEN</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-05-01'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> AND</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> '2026-05-07'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> event_type</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cnt </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>分区（Partition）</strong> 和 <strong>分桶（Bucket）</strong> 是 Hive 性能优化的两大核心手段。分区按业务维度（如日期）物理隔离数据，分桶按哈希值将数据均匀分布，加速 JOIN 和采样。</p>\n<h3 id=\"hbase-列式存储\">HBase 列式存储</h3><p>HBase 是基于 HDFS 的分布式列族数据库，适合海量数据的随机实时读写：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"java\" data-code=\"// HBase Java API 示例&#10;Put put = new Put(Bytes.toBytes(&quot;user_1001&quot;));&#10;put.addColumn(&#10;    Bytes.toBytes(&quot;profile&quot;),          // 列族&#10;    Bytes.toBytes(&quot;name&quot;),             // 列限定符&#10;    Bytes.toBytes(&quot;张三&quot;)              // 值&#10;);&#10;table.put(put);&#10;&#10;// Scan 范围查询&#10;Scan scan = new Scan();&#10;scan.setStartRow(Bytes.toBytes(&quot;user_1000&quot;));&#10;scan.setStopRow(Bytes.toBytes(&quot;user_2000&quot;));&#10;scan.addColumn(Bytes.toBytes(&quot;profile&quot;), Bytes.toBytes(&quot;name&quot;));\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// HBase Java API 示例</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Put put </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_1001\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">put.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addColumn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),          </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 列族</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">),             </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 列限定符</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"张三\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)              </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 值</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">table.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">put</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(put);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// Scan 范围查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">Scan scan </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> new</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> Scan</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scan.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStartRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_1000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scan.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">setStopRow</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"user_2000\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">scan.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">addColumn</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"profile\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), Bytes.</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">toBytes</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">\"name\"</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span></code></pre></div><p>HBase 的 RowKey 设计直接决定查询性能：避免热点（加盐/反转）、支持范围扫描（时间戳前缀）、控制长度（通常 &lt; 100 字节）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"数据仓库分层架构\">数据仓库分层架构</h3><p>企业级数据仓库通常采用经典的分层设计：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    S[&quot;数据源&quot;] --&gt; ODS[&quot;ODS 原始层&quot;]&#10;    ODS --&gt; DWD[&quot;DWD 明细层&quot;]&#10;    DWD --&gt; DWS[&quot;DWS 汇总层&quot;]&#10;    DWS --&gt; ADS[&quot;ADS 应用层&quot;]&#10;    ADS --&gt; BI[&quot;BI 报表&quot;]&#10;    ADS --&gt; API[&quot;数据服务&quot;]\">graph LR\n    S[\"数据源\"] --&gt; ODS[\"ODS 原始层\"]\n    ODS --&gt; DWD[\"DWD 明细层\"]\n    DWD --&gt; DWS[\"DWS 汇总层\"]\n    DWS --&gt; ADS[\"ADS 应用层\"]\n    ADS --&gt; BI[\"BI 报表\"]\n    ADS --&gt; API[\"数据服务\"]</pre><ul>\n<li><strong>ODS</strong>：原始数据落地，不做清洗</li>\n<li><strong>DWD</strong>：数据清洗、去重、维度关联</li>\n<li><strong>DWS</strong>：按主题域汇总（用户、商品、交易）</li>\n<li><strong>ADS</strong>：面向具体业务场景的指标表</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"前沿动态\">前沿动态</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Hadoop 云原生化</strong>：Ozone 取代 HDFS 支持对象存储语义，适配 K8s 部署</li>\n<li><strong>Hive on Tez/LLAP</strong>：Hive 4.x 通过 LLAP 缓存层实现亚秒级交互查询</li>\n<li><strong>数据湖仓一体</strong>：Apache Iceberg/Delta Lake 在 HDFS/对象存储上提供 ACID 事务和时间旅行</li>\n<li><strong>NameNode 联邦</strong>：解决单点元数据瓶颈，支持百亿级文件数</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>在本地伪分布式环境中搭建 Hadoop 集群，上传一个 1GB 的文本文件到 HDFS，观察块分布情况</li>\n<li>用 Hadoop Streaming 实现一个日志分析 MapReduce 作业：统计每个 URL 路径的访问次数</li>\n<li>在 Hive 中创建一个按天分区的用户行为表，加载 7 天数据后执行留存分析查询</li>\n<li>思考：副本因子 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n = 3</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span></span></span></span></span> 意味着存储成本是原始数据的 3 倍，如何在可靠性和成本之间取得平衡？纠删码（Erasure Coding）是更好的方案吗？</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>Hadoop 生态奠定了大数据技术的基础设施层：HDFS 提供可靠的分布式存储，YARN 实现弹性资源管理，MapReduce 定义了分布式计算的基本范式，Hive 桥接了 SQL 分析与分布式存储，HBase 补充了实时随机访问能力。虽然新一代引擎在性能上全面超越了原生 MapReduce，但 Hadoop 的架构思想——数据本地性、容错设计、水平扩展——仍然是理解所有分布式系统的思维基础。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"Hadoop 生态","id":"hadoop-生态"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":3,"text":"HDFS 分布式文件系统","id":"hdfs-分布式文件系统"},{"level":3,"text":"MapReduce 编程模型","id":"mapreduce-编程模型"},{"level":3,"text":"YARN 资源管理","id":"yarn-资源管理"},{"level":3,"text":"Hive 数据仓库","id":"hive-数据仓库"},{"level":3,"text":"HBase 列式存储","id":"hbase-列式存储"},{"level":3,"text":"数据仓库分层架构","id":"数据仓库分层架构"},{"level":2,"text":"前沿动态","id":"前沿动态"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Linux 与 Shell 脚本","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/data-programming-basics/linux-shell-scripting"},"next":{"title":"Spark 计算引擎","url":"/l-doc-books/education/vocational/higher-vocational/big-data-technology/big-data-platforms/spark-computing"}}